{"summary":"白鳝泥是《本草纲目》记载的一种药用泥土，外用可治火带疮（带状疱疹）。使用时将泥水洗后炒研，以香油调敷患处。性味不详。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"火带疮，水洗取泥炒研，香油调敷（时珍）。","translation":"治疗火带疮（带状疱疹）：用水洗后取泥，炒干研细，用香油调匀敷患处。（李时珍）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#白鱔泥","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}